# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local `wrangler pages dev` (never commit .dev.vars).
# IMPORTANT: Generate a unique random JWT_SECRET for both development AND production.
# For production, use a cryptographically secure random string (min 32 characters).
JWT_SECRET="replace-with-a-long-random-local-dev-secret"

# D1 Database and R2 Bucket bindings are configured in wrangler.toml
# For local development:
#   - Ensure D1 database is initialized: npm run db:migrate:local
#   - R2 bucket will work with local emulation via wrangler
#
# For production:
#   - CRITICAL: Update wrangler.toml with production D1 database_id
#   - CRITICAL: Ensure R2 bucket is created and permissions are correct
#   - Ensure JWT_SECRET is set as a Cloudflare secret (not in .dev.vars)

